      "Canonical files equal adopted1b30 bytes. KRuntimeCore/KBoot also equal the source commit bytes. KZip deliberately differs from upstream only by the retained phase23 removal of the unused zc simp entry in step_zc; the corresponding baseline difference is the same. No restoration of old warning text occurs.",
